hyperactive-interaction-in-the-words-of-the-human-superorganism-4 = unlines (cons "What the seed, the hyperactive kernel that every device carries, does is reduce active pairs. In Lafont's nets the cells are called agents, from *agere*, to drive. Two agents meet at their principal ports, and the meeting is an interaction: driving between. Nothing computes alone. So the machine at the bottom of the stack is already the thing in the headline, Hyperactive Interaction, before any human touches a screen." nil)
